th":"$.shopItemId","description":"商品ID","source_field":"ext","property_name":"ext.shopItemId","property_type":"数值","property_display_name":"商品ID"},{"json_path":"$.shopId","description":"商店ID","source_field":"ext","property_name":"ext.shopId","property_type":"数值","property_display_name":"商店ID"}],"event_category":"Shop","event_display_name":"商店购买真实使用"},{"event_name":"WorldCupPointReward","properties":[{"json_path":"$.rewardId","description":"奖励ID","source_field":"ext","property_name":"ext.rewardId","property_type":"数值","property_display_name":"奖励ID"}],"event_category":"Activity","event_display_name":"世界杯积分奖励"},{"event_name":"WorldCupPointChange","properties":[{"json_path":"$.totalNum","description":"当日总积分","source_field":"ext","property_name":"ext.totalNum","property_type":"数值","property_display_name":"当日总积分"},{"json_path":"$.changeSource","description":"变更来源","source_field":"ext","property_name":"ext.changeSource","property_type":"数值","property_display_name":"变更来源"}],"event_category":"Activity","event_display_name":"世界杯积分变化"},{"event_name":"WorldCupExchange","properties":[{"json_path":"$.costNum","description":"消耗数量","source_field":"ext","property_name":"ext.costNum","property_type":"数值","property_display_name":"消耗数量"},{"json_path":"$.itemNum","description":"兑换数量","source_field":"ext","property_name":"ext.itemNum","property_type":"数值","property_display_name":"兑换数量"},{"json_path":"$.itemId","description":"道具ID","source_field":"ext","property_name":"ext.itemId","property_type":"数值","property_display_name":"道具ID"}],"event_category":"Activity","event_display_name":"世界杯兑换"},{"event_name":"WorldCupRoll","properties":[{"json_path":"$.rollNum","description":"投掷的点数","source_field":"ext","property_name":"ext.rollNum","property_type":"数值","property_display_name":"投掷的点数"},{"json_path":"$.eventId","description":"事件ID","source_field":"ext","property_name":"ext.eventId","property_type":"数值","property_display_n\n...（已截断）\n</tracking-config>\n\n当前配置器可配置的控件：时间范围(time.field/time.grain/time.range)、分析指标(metrics: 字段/聚合/计算字段/别名/指标内筛选树)、公式指标(formulaMetrics/calculatedMetrics: token 化公式/小数/别名)、全局筛选、分组项(groups)。\n配置器规则：time.field + time.grain 会自动生成日期维度；groups 只表示额外维度，不包含时间维度也不是错误。\n公式指标规则：formulaMetrics[].tokens 是公式 token 列表；token.type=metric 时只能引用 metrics 中已有指标，并使用 metricAlias 对应的基础指标结果；token.type=atomicMetric 时表示公式内部直接插入的事件指标，结构与 metrics 单项类似，必须按它自己的 field/metric/aggregation/filters 生成基础聚合；token.type=operator 只能是 + - * /；token.type=paren 只能是 ( )；token.type=number 只能是数字常量。\n生成公式指标 SQL 时，必须先在内层/CTE 计算全部基础 metrics 和公式内 atomicMetric，再在外层 SELECT 中按 token 公式计算公式指标；除法必须使用 NULLIF(分母表达式, 0) 防止除零；小数位必须用 ROUND(公式表达式, decimalPlaces)；公式指标别名使用 alias。\n当 metrics.field.kind 为 tracking-event 时，它表示从“事件参数对照”中选择的业务事件；生成 SQL 时必须使用 metrics.field.eventTable 和 metrics.field.eventNameField（或 table/field）定位事件名字段，并添加“事件名字段 = metrics.field.eventName”的过滤条件。\n如果多个 tracking-event 指标来自同一张事件表、同一个事件名字段，但 eventName 不同，必须在 WHERE 中使用“事件名字段 IN (这些 eventName)”先收窄扫描范围，再在各指标表达式里用 CASE WHEN 区分每个事件；不要只在 COUNT/SUM CASE 里写事件条件而让 WHERE 扫全表。\n当指标内筛选 rules[].field.kind 为 tracking-property 时，它表示该业务事件下的事件参数；生成 SQL 时必须按 rules[].field.sourceField/jsonPath 或 field 在事件明细行中取值，再应用对应 operator/value。\n只允许使用 manual-dashboard-context 里的 selectedFields/metrics/formulaMetrics/calculatedMetrics/groups/filters 字段信息生成 SQL；不要编造未提供字段。', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'qwen3.5-plus', 'stream': True, 'stream_options': {'include_usage': True}, 'temperature': 0.6}}
